From: Codex local A376B compatibility adaptation
Subject: [PATCH] Keep AZH4 Smart View tile initialization

Reason: attempt30.txt:1261 reports the CSC Smart View visibility patch context
is absent in AZH4 QpRune initialization. Preserve donor SystemUI behavior on
A376B Android16; keep the fork patch for other donors.
Files: scripts/internal/apply_modules.sh.
Verification: exact SystemUI patch/profile guard, shell syntax, patch replay and
clean attempt31. Revert0062.

---
--- a/scripts/internal/apply_modules.sh
+++ b/scripts/internal/apply_modules.sh
@@ -130,6 +130,11 @@ APPLY_SMALI_PATCHES()
             LOGW "A376B AZH4 relocated Secure Folder Settings classes; retaining donor behavior for M2"
             continue
         fi
+        if [ "${ROM_SOURCE_CONFIG:-}" = "essi_a376b_android16" ] && \
+                [[ "$p" == */csc/smali/system_ext/priv-app/SystemUI/SystemUI.apk/0002-Enable-Smart-View-tile-visibility-settings.patch ]]; then
+            LOGW "A376B AZH4 changed QpRune tile initialization; retaining donor Smart View UI for M2"
+            continue
+        fi
         APPLY_PATCH "$PARTITION" "$FILE" "$p"
